Package: BBMM
Type: Package
Title: Brownian Bridge Movement Model
Version: 3.0.9001
Author: R. M. Nielson [aut], H. Sawyer [aut], T. L. McDonald [aut], Ryan Nielson [cre]
Maintainer: Ryan Nielson <rnielson@west-inc.com>
Description: The model provides an empirical estimate of a movement
        path using discrete location data obtained at relatively short
        time intervals.
